                                <div class="right">

            <div class="bottom haber-d">
                <img class="img-fluid"  src="https://www.dp.org.tr/storage/posts/October2021/yhtCYEgZhphx5yNX9gn8.jpg"  alt="">
                <div class="mt-2 date ml-auto" style="display: flex; float:left">05/10/2021</div>
                <ul style="display:flex; float:right; margin-top:10px">
                    <li style="margin-right:10px" class="ml-3"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https://www.dp.org.tr/haber/demokrat-parti-ekonomik-i-sler-baskani-bulent-sahinalp-enflasyon-rakamlarini-degerlendirdi"><i style="font-size:20px; color:#4D4D4D" class="fab fa-facebook"></i></a></li>
                    <li style="margin-right:10px" class="ml-3"><a href="https://twitter.com/share?url=https://www.dp.org.tr/haber/demokrat-parti-ekonomik-i-sler-baskani-bulent-sahinalp-enflasyon-rakamlarini-degerlendirdi"><i style="font-size:20px; color:#4D4D4D" class="fab fa-twitter"></i></a></li>
                    <li style="margin-right:10px" class="ml-3"><a href="http://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?url=https://www.dp.org.tr/haber/demokrat-parti-ekonomik-i-sler-baskani-bulent-sahinalp-enflasyon-rakamlarini-degerlendirdi"><i style="font-size:20px; color:#4D4D4D" class="fab fa-linkedin"></i></a></li>
                </ul>
                <h1>Demokrat Parti Ekonomik İşler Başkanı Bülent Şahinalp, enflasyon rakamlarını değerlendirdi</h1>
                <br>
                <br>
                <br>
                <p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;" align="center"><strong><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0f1419; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&ldquo;Enflasyon Eyl&uuml;l&rsquo;de tırmanışa ge&ccedil;ti, &ccedil;ok zor bir kış hepimizi bekliyor!&rdquo;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0f1419; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;" align="center"><em><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&ldquo;Her şeye yetkili ama sorumsuz bir iktidar! Siz neden sorumlusunuz?&rdquo;</span></em></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0f1419; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0f1419; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0f1419; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">(DP Basın Merkezi &ndash; 05 Ekim 2021) </span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Demokrat Parti Ekonomik İşlerden Sorumlu Genel Başkan Yardımcısı B&uuml;lent Şahinalp, son a&ccedil;ıklanan enflasyon rakamlarını değerlendirdi.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Şahinalp, yaptığı yazılı a&ccedil;ıklamada T&Uuml;İK tarafından a&ccedil;ıklanan son enflasyon rakamlarının ger&ccedil;ek enflasyonu yansıtmadığını ifade etti.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Ekonominin i&ccedil;inde bulunduğu &ccedil;ıkmazdan bug&uuml;nk&uuml; iktidarın sorumlu olduğuna dikkat &ccedil;eken Şahnalp, <strong>&ldquo;<span style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">19 yıldır iktidardalar ama y&uuml;ksek </span></strong></span><a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Faiz?src=hashtag_click"><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0f1419; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-decoration-line: none;">faiz</span></strong></a><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">den sorumlu olanlar &ldquo;bankalar ve faiz lobisi&rdquo;, y&uuml;ksek d&ouml;viz kurlarından sorumlu olanlar &ldquo;Dış G&uuml;&ccedil;ler&rdquo;, </span></strong><a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/%C4%B0%C5%9Fsizlik?src=hashtag_click"><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0f1419; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-decoration-line: none;">işsizlik</span></strong></a><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">ten sorumlu olanlar &ldquo;sanayici ve t&uuml;ccar&rdquo;, </span></strong><a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Enflasyon?src=hashtag_click"><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0f1419; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-decoration-line: none;">enflasyon</span></strong></a><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">dan sorumlu olanlar ise &ldquo;zincir marketler&rdquo;!. O zaman bu İktidara sormak lazım. Peki, siz neden sorumlusunuz? Her şeye yetkili ama sorumsuz bir iktidar!&rdquo;</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"> eleştirisinde bulundu. </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0f1419; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Demokrat Parti Genel Başkan Yardımcısı B&uuml;lent Şahinalp&rsquo;in yaptığı yazılı a&ccedil;ıklama ş&ouml;yle:</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0f1419; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;" align="center"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0f1419; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&ldquo;&Ccedil;ekirdek Enflasyon arttı&rdquo;</span></em></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #202124; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">&ldquo;T.C. Merkez Bankası&rsquo;nın Ağustos&rsquo;ta enerji, gıda ve alkols&uuml;z i&ccedil;ecekler, alkoll&uuml; i&ccedil;kiler ile t&uuml;t&uuml;n ve altın fiyatlarındaki değişimleri dışlayarak elde edilen C &ccedil;ekirdek enflasyonu para politikası i&ccedil;in baz alacağını a&ccedil;ıklayıp, s&uuml;rpriz şekilde 100 baz puan indirimle Politika faizini y&uuml;zde 18&rsquo;e &ccedil;ekmesi sonrası, her kesimin g&ouml;z&uuml; T&Uuml;İK&rsquo;in a&ccedil;ıklayacağı enflasyon verisinde idi.&nbsp; </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #202124; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">T&Uuml;İK'e g&ouml;re, Eyl&uuml;l ayında T&uuml;ketici Fiyat Endeksi </span><a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/T%C3%9CFE?src=hashtag_click"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: windowtext; text-decoration-line: none;">T&Uuml;FE</span></a><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;"> aylık bazda y&uuml;zde 1,25 ve yıllık bazda y&uuml;zde 19,58 arttı. Yıllık artış oranının en y&uuml;ksek olduğu gruplar, y&uuml;zde 28,79 ile gıda ve alkols&uuml;z i&ccedil;ecekler, y&uuml;zde 23,27 ile ev eşyası, y&uuml;zde 23,27 ile lokanta ve oteller, y&uuml;zde 20,97 ile konut ve y&uuml;zde 20,21 ile ulaştırma oldu. Piyasanın daha fazla dikkat ettiği g&ouml;sterge olan &Ccedil;ekirdek Enflasyon ise,</span> <span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Ağustos&rsquo;taki gerilemenin aksine, Eyl&uuml;l&rsquo;de yıllık y&uuml;zde 16,76&rsquo;dan y&uuml;zde 16,98 seviyesine &ccedil;ıktı.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;" align="center"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">&ldquo;İnsanımız her an ger&ccedil;ek enflasyonu yaşıyor&rdquo;</span></em></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Oysa milyonlarca insanımız sokakta, &ccedil;arşıda, pazarda, markette, bakkalda, halde her g&uuml;n ger&ccedil;ek enflasyonu yaşıyor. A&ccedil;ık&ccedil;ası c&uuml;zdanına yansıyan fiyat artışının bunun &ccedil;ok &uuml;zerinde olduğunu herkes biliyor. </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #0f1419;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Nitekim akademisyenlerin oluşturduğu bağımsız Enflasyon Araştırma Grubu </span><a href="https://twitter.com/ENAGRUP"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: windowtext; text-decoration-line: none;">ENAGrup</span></a><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;"> 'a g&ouml;re, ENAGrup T&uuml;ketici Fiyat Endeksi Eyl&uuml;l ayında y&uuml;zde 2.89 arttı. ENAGrup T&uuml;ketici Fiyat Endeksi, E-T&Uuml;FE'deki 12 aylık artış oranı ise y&uuml;zde 44.70 olarak ger&ccedil;ekleşti. </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;" align="center"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&ldquo;Anlaşılan bu iktidar ile bir s&uuml;re daha enflasyon ile yaşamaya mahk&ucirc;muz!&rdquo;</span></em></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Diğer taraftan, T&Uuml;İK verilerine g&ouml;re, Yurt İ&ccedil;i &Uuml;retici Fiyat Endeksi (Yİ-&Uuml;FE) aylık y&uuml;zde 1,55 ve yıllık y&uuml;zde 43,96 arttı. Ağustos ayında Yİ-&Uuml;FE y&uuml;zde 45,52 seviyesindeydi. &Uuml;retici ve t&uuml;ketici enflasyonu arasındaki fark 24.38 puan oldu. &Uuml;retici fiyatlarının hafif gerilemesi ve t&uuml;ketici enflasyonunun artması farkın az da olsa d&uuml;şmesini sağladı.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">&Ouml;n&uuml;m&uuml;zdeki aylarda &Uuml;retici fiyatlarının kısmen de olsa, T&uuml;ketici fiyatlarına yansımasını beklemeliyiz. <span style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Nitekim TCMB beklenti anketine g&ouml;re, Enflasyonda 12 ay sonrası beklenti y&uuml;zde 12,9 ve 24 ay sonrası beklenti ise y&uuml;zde 10,7 seviyesindedir. Anlaşılan bu iktidar ile bir s&uuml;re daha enflasyon ile yaşamaya mahk&ucirc;muz!</span></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;" align="center"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">&ldquo;Yeniden bir faiz artışına gidilmesi ka&ccedil;ınılmaz g&ouml;z&uuml;k&uuml;yor&rdquo;</span></em></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">T&Uuml;FE'de yıllık enflasyonun Eyl&uuml;lde y&uuml;zde 19,58'e &ccedil;ıkması sonrası TCMB faizi ile T&Uuml;FE arasındaki fark 1,58 puana y&uuml;kseldi. Enflasyonun &ouml;n&uuml;m&uuml;zdeki aylarda y&uuml;zde 20'ye yakın seyretmesi halinde, TCMB'nin yeniden bir faiz artışına gitmesi ka&ccedil;ınılmaz g&ouml;z&uuml;k&uuml;yor. Aksi takdirde, her g&uuml;n yeni bir rekor kıran d&ouml;viz kurları yeniden kontrolden &ccedil;ıkabilir!</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;" align="center"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&ldquo;Marketlere m&uuml;fettiş g&ouml;ndererek enflasyon &ouml;nlenemez&rdquo;</span></em></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Enflasyonu &ouml;nlemenin yolu; depoları basmak, &uuml;reticiyi su&ccedil;lamak, marketlere m&uuml;fettiş g&ouml;ndermek ya da ilave kooperatif marketler a&ccedil;makla olamaz. Nitekim ge&ccedil;mişte denenen Tanzim satışların hi&ccedil;bir faydası g&ouml;r&uuml;lmedi. </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Bunu d&uuml;zeltmenin tek yolu &uuml;retime y&ouml;nelik yanlış politikaları d&uuml;zeltmekten ve &uuml;retimi artırmaktan ge&ccedil;er.&nbsp;Oysaki mevcut iktidar &ouml;zellikle tarımsal &uuml;r&uuml;nlerde, kendi &ccedil;ift&ccedil;isini desteklemek yerine, yurt dışından ithalat yoluyla yabancı &uuml;lke &ccedil;ift&ccedil;ilerini desteklemektedir. </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;" align="center"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&ldquo;Girdi fiyatları mutlaka d&uuml;ş&uuml;r&uuml;lmelidir&rdquo;</span></em></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&Ouml;ncelikle yapılması gereken, tanzim satış ya da market a&ccedil;mak değil, &uuml;retimde kullanılan girdi fiyatlarını d&uuml;ş&uuml;rmektir. &Ccedil;ift&ccedil;imizin kullandığı g&uuml;brede son 12 ay i&ccedil;inde fiyat artışları y&uuml;zde 157&rsquo;ye kadar ulaştı. Bu konuda iktidarın her hangi bir planı ya da aldığı tedbir var mı?</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Son haftalarda b&uuml;t&uuml;n d&uuml;nyada petrol ve doğalgaz fiyatlarında b&uuml;y&uuml;k artışlar yaşanıyor. K&uuml;resel petrol piyasasının en &ouml;nemli g&ouml;sterge Brent ham petrol&uuml; 80 dolar/varil seviyesini aştı, 90-100 dolar seviyeleri konuşulmaya başladı. Mayıs 2020&rsquo;den bu yana g&ouml;sterge doğalgaz vadelilerinin y&uuml;zde1,300 artış kaydetti. </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;" align="center"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&ldquo;Avrupa&rsquo;da başlayan enerji krizi t&uuml;keticinin cebinde hissedilecek&rdquo;</span></em></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Avrupa'da başlayan enerji krizinin d&uuml;nyanın geri kalanına da yayılması, fabrikalarda &uuml;retimleri aksatması ve milyonlarca t&uuml;keticinin enerji fiyatlarındaki y&uuml;kselişi faturalarında ve c&uuml;zdanlarında hissetmesi bekleniyor. </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;" align="center"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&ldquo;&Ccedil;ok zor bir kış hepimizi bekliyor&rdquo;</span></em></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">B&ouml;yle bir konjonkt&uuml;rde iktidar, yılbaşına kadar enflasyonu y&uuml;kseltmemek ve ilave faiz indirimleri ger&ccedil;ekleştirmek amacıyla, konutlarda kullanılan elektrik ve doğal gaza zam yapmamayı tercih etti. Ancak sanayi ve elektrik santrallerinde kullanılan doğal gaza yapılan y&uuml;zde 15 zam t&uuml;m fiyatları etkileyecek. &Ccedil;ok zor bir kış hepimizi bekliyor. </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">2020 sonu itibariyle; iflas etti denilen </span><a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Arjantin?src=hashtag_click"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: windowtext; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-decoration-line: none;">Arjantin</span></a><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">'de kişi başı milli gelir 9,100 Dolar, ucuz iş&ccedil;ilik &uuml;lkesi diye bilinen 1,5 milyar n&uuml;fuslu </span><a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/%C3%87in?src=hashtag_click"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: windowtext; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-decoration-line: none;">&Ccedil;in</span></a><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">'de kişi başına milli gelir 11,700 Dolar, </span><a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/T%C3%BCrkiye?src=hashtag_click"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: windowtext; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-decoration-line: none;">T&uuml;rkiye</span></a><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">'de ise 7,700 Dolara geriledi. </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;" align="center"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&ldquo;Halkımız s&uuml;rekli olarak fakirleşiyor&rdquo;</span></em></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">D&ouml;viz kurlarında yaşanan artışlar sonrası, &uuml;lkemizde asgari &uuml;cret seviyesi 320 Dolar ile &Ccedil;in&rsquo;deki 340 Dolarlık seviyenin bile gerisine d&uuml;şt&uuml;. Halkımız &ouml;zellikle 7 yıldır s&uuml;rekli olarak fakirleşiyor. Fileler dolmuyor, tencereler ise bomboş!&nbsp; İşte, 19 yıldır &uuml;lkeyi kesintisiz ve tek başına y&ouml;neten iktidarın ekonomideki başarısı! <strong>&ldquo;Ekonomimiz u&ccedil;uyor&rdquo;</strong> t&uuml;r&uuml; algı y&ouml;netimine artık kimse inanmıyor!</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;" align="center"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">&ldquo;D&uuml;nyanın en pahalı bor&ccedil;lanan &uuml;lkelerinden birisiyiz&rdquo;</span></em></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Bu arada, <strong>T&uuml;rkiye&rsquo;nin CDS</strong></span> <strong><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">yani Credit Default Swap (Kredi Risk Primi) de 434 puana y&uuml;kseldi.</span></strong> <span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Bir &uuml;lkenin ya da şirketin CDS primi ne kadar y&uuml;ksekse bor&ccedil;lanma maliyeti de o kadar y&uuml;ksek demektir. &Ccedil;&uuml;nk&uuml; bu prim ister istemez faize yansımaktadır. Nitekim Hazinenin ge&ccedil;tiğimiz g&uuml;nlerde yaptığı dolar cinsi bor&ccedil;lanmada faiz oranı y&uuml;zde 6,5 ger&ccedil;ekleşti. Gerek Hazine gerekse &ouml;zel sekt&ouml;r, D&uuml;nyanın en pahalı bor&ccedil;lanan &uuml;lkelerinden birisiyiz. </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;" align="center"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&ldquo;Her şeye yetkili ama sorumsuz bir iktidar!&rdquo;</span></em></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">19 yıldır iktidardalar ama y&uuml;ksek </span><a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Faiz?src=hashtag_click"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0f1419; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-decoration-line: none;">faiz</span></a><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">den sorumlu olanlar <strong>&ldquo;bankalar ve faiz lobisi&rdquo;</strong>, y&uuml;ksek d&ouml;viz kurlarından sorumlu olanlar <strong>&ldquo;Dış G&uuml;&ccedil;ler&rdquo;</strong>, </span><a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/%C4%B0%C5%9Fsizlik?src=hashtag_click"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0f1419; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-decoration-line: none;">işsizlik</span></a><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">ten sorumlu olanlar <strong>&ldquo;sanayici ve t&uuml;ccar&rdquo;</strong>, </span><a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Enflasyon?src=hashtag_click"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0f1419; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-decoration-line: none;">enflasyon</span></a><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">dan sorumlu olanlar ise <strong>&ldquo;zincir marketler&rdquo;</strong>!. O zaman bu İktidara sormak lazım. Peki, siz neden sorumlusunuz? Her şeye yetkili ama sorumsuz bir iktidar! </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Halkımız, yaşanan bunca sıkıntı ve zorluğun hesabını sandık &ouml;n&uuml;ne geldiğinde mutlaka soracak ve <strong>&ldquo;Yeter S&ouml;z Milletindir&rdquo;</strong> diyecektir.&rdquo;</span></p></p>
            </div>
        </div>
            </div>
</section>


